<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Your Plan Has Been Upgraded</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px;">
    <h1 style="color: #2c3e50; margin-top: 0;">Plan Upgraded!</h1>

    <p>Hi {{userName}},</p>

    <p>Great news! The plan for <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong> has been successfully upgraded.</p>

    <div style="background-color: #fff; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-left: 4px solid #27ae60;">
      <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>Previous plan:</strong> {{previousPlanId}}</p>
      <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0;"><strong>New plan:</strong> {{newPlanId}}</p>
    </div>

    <p>Your new plan is now active. Enjoy the additional features and capacity!</p>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
      <a href="{{billingPortalUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #27ae60; color: #fff; padding: 12px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;">Manage Billing</a>
    </div>

    <p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 14px;">
      If you have any questions about your new plan, please don't hesitate to contact our support team.
    </p>

    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; margin: 30px 0;">

    <p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;">
      If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>
      <a href="{{billingPortalUrl}}" style="color: #27ae60;">{{billingPortalUrl}}</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
